re."], ["Zoho People Ecosystem Power: This is Zoho People\u2019s unbeatable advantage. Its native, deep integration with Zoho One tools means HR data flows automatically into your CRM (Zoho CRM), Finance (Zoho Books/Invoice), Projects (Zoho Projects), and IT (Zoho Desk/Vault). For a company aiming for an entire unified, single-vendor operating system, this is a non-negotiable factor that simplifies IT, vendor management, and data reporting.", "Keka\u2019s Integration: Keka integrates well with necessary third-party tools (like Tally, QuickBooks, and specific biometric devices) essential for payroll and accounting. It offers a capable API for custom connections. However, it does not offer the same holistic, single-vendor ecosystem breadth as Zoho. The focus is on being the best HRMS, not a full business suite."], ["Pro (ROI): If you are already a Zoho One customer, the overall cost of acquiring Zoho People is significantly lower, offering massive ROI due to the ecosystem benefit. The entry-level price is extremely attractive. Zoho Payroll is also free for up to 10 employees.", "Con: Advanced features and the necessary integrations (like Zoho Payroll/Recruit) often require combining modules, which can make the total cost creep up for a full-suite solution."], ["Pro (ROI): Very straightforward, \u201cwhat you see is what you get\u201d pricing. Often includes highly specialized Indian compliance features standard. High employee adoption due to the excellent UX boosts engagement ROI.", "Con: Can be a higher initial per-employee cost compared to Zoho People\u2019s entry-level plans, especially for smaller teams who don\u2019t need the full feature set."], ["\u2705 You are (or plan to be) a Zoho One customer. The cost and efficiency benefits of the unified ecosystem are too great to ignore.", "\u2705 Your business operates globally or requires a highly customizable, multi-country HR setup and complex workflows.", "\u2705 You require a highly advanced, integrated ATS (via Zoho Recruit) and the ability to build custom applications on top of your HR data.", "\u2705 You prioritize flexibility and deep configuration over out-of-the-box simplicity."], ["\u2705 Your primary challenge is Indian statutory payroll and compliance. Keka\u2019s compliance engine is a leading, specialized product in this space.", "\u2705 You prioritize employee adoption and User Experience (UX). Keka\u2019s UI is frequently praised for its modern design and ease of use, leading to higher self-service adoption.", "\u2705 You are a mid-market company whose HR needs are complex but do not require the multi-app ecosystem of Zoho One.", "\u2705 You want continuous performance management and feedback to be seamlessly integrated into the daily flow of work."], ["About", "Blog", "Contact", "Home", "Privacy Policy", "Services", "Zoho CRM Company Logo Fetch", "zoho server status"], ["Introduction", "About Us", "PAY NOW"]], "tables": [[["Feature", "Zoho People", "Keka", "Strategic Insight"], ["Tracking Flexibility", "Highly flexible. Supports geo-fencing, IP restrictions, biometrics, and mobile check-in. Strong location-based security.", "Excellent. Offers precise clock-in/out, biometric, and geo-fenced attendance. Strong for field employees.", "Zoho People offers deeper, more granular rules for complex/global policies. Keka is praised for its simplicity and ease-of-use on the mobile app."], ["Leave Management", "Robust. Highly customizable leave types, accrual rules, and carry-forward settings. Integrated with calendar apps.", "Industry-leading simplicity. Extremely simple application/approval process. Very strong visibility on leave balances and clear policy enforcement.", "Both are excellent. Keka often wins on pure employee experience; Zoho People wins on policy customization depth."], ["Shift Management", "Advanced. Excellent for complex shift scheduling, rotating shifts, and shift swaps across multiple locations/time zones.", "Strong, but its primary focus is on simplifying fixed and routine rotational shifts.", "Zoho People is better for businesses with fluid, 24/7 or international workforces."]], [["Area", "Zoho People", "Keka"], ["Review Types", "Supports 360-degree feedback, goal-based, competency-based, and KRA-based reviews.", "Supports 360-degree, OKR-focused (Objectives and Key Results), KRA-based, and custom forms."], ["Goal Management", "Integrated with Zoho Projects/Connect. Excellent for cascading organizational goals down to individuals (cascading OKRs).", "Strong OKR focus with a clear, visual dashboard. Empowers employees to track progress daily. Often considered easier for the average employee to use."], ["Continuous Feedback", "Robust features for continuous check-ins, one-on-ones, and informal feedback logging. Deeply integrated with the Zoho ecosystem.", "Exceptional \u2014its focus on employee experience makes logging and requesting feedback very easy and highly adopted by users."]], [["UX Metric", "Zoho People", "Keka"], ["User Interface (UI)", "Highly functional, but can feel slightly complex or cluttered due to the sheer number of features and customization options.", "Modern, Clean, and Highly Intuitive. Designed to be immediately accessible to all employees."], ["Ease of Administration", "Very powerful, but requires more setup and configuration time due to the high level of customization available.", "Easier to administer for core HR functions and payroll. Built-in compliance simplifies admin tasks significantly."], ["Mobile App", "Excellent features for clock-in/out, leave requests, and payslip viewing. Full-featured but sometimes criticized for a steeper learning curve.", "Exceptional. Frequently rated higher by users for its speed, simplicity, and ease of use for ESS (Employee Self-Service) tasks."]]], "code_blocks": [], "meta_description": "Deciding between Zoho People and Keka for your HRMS? Get the ultimate feature-by-feature breakdown on pricing, payroll, performance, and UI. Compare Zoho People vs. Keka and choose the best fit to transform your HR operations today.", "meta_keywords": "", "og_image": "https://codroiditlabs.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Zoho_People_vs_Keka.jpg", "js_rendered": true, "js_message": "Page appears to be rendered by a JavaScript framework; content may be incomplete.", "success": true, "error": ""}}